{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/5100","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/5100/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/5100/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/issues/5100/events","html_url":"https://github.com/nodejs/node/issues/5100","id":131617431,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMzE2MTc0MzE=","number":5100,"title":"TLS fails reading self-signed certificate on node 4.2.5+","user":{"login":"dbkup","id":8588007,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODgwMDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8588007?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup","html_url":"https://github.com/dbkup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbkup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":151728674,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTE3Mjg2NzQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/labels/confirmed-bug","name":"confirmed-bug","color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":"Issues with confirmed bugs."},{"id":155267349,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNTUyNjczNDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/labels/tls","name":"tls","color":"fad8c7","default":false,"description":"Issues and PRs related to the tls subsystem."},{"id":279202658,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkyMDI2NTg=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nodejs/node/labels/lts","name":"lts","color":"c7def8","default":false,"description":"Issues and PRs related to Long Term Support releases."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2016-02-05T11:19:09Z","updated_at":"2016-02-08T19:43:22Z","closed_at":"2016-02-08T19:43:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I'm having an issue with ssl certificate validation using the `tls` module. The server is started with:\n\n```\ntls.createServer({\n        pfx: fs.readFileSync(config.certFile),\n        passphrase: config.keyPass,\n        requestCert: true, \n        rejectUnauthorized: false \n    }, ...);\n```\n\nThe client:\n\n```\ntls.connect({\n    port: config.port,\n    host:config.host,\n    pfx: fs.readFileSync(config.cert),\n    passphrase: config.pass,\n    rejectUnauthorized: false\n});\n```\n\nMy issue is that I get `tlsSocket.authorizationError` SELF_SIGNED_CERT_IN_CHAIN on v4.2.5+ but not on older versions. Here's my output on a Windows machine, but the same happens on an Ubuntu server.\n\n```\n>nodist 4.2.5\n>node --version\nv4.2.5\n\n>node server.js\nserver started:\nauth->SELF_SIGNED_CERT_IN_CHAIN\n\n>nodist 4.2.4\nnodev4.2.4\n\n>node server.js\nserver started:\nauth->null\n```\n\nThe `auth->` line is printed to console with the `tlsSocket.authorizationError` parameter when a client connects. In the case of a successful connect this field is `null`. \nTested down to 0.12.9, all versions read the certificate without issues.\n","closed_by":{"login":"indutny","id":238531,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzODUzMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238531?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/indutny","html_url":"https://github.com/indutny","followers_url":"https://api.